codex
The failure is explained by the sandbox’s PID namespace: Lean asks for `/proc/<inner-pid>/exe`, while the mounted `/proc` exposes the outer PID. I added an audit-only preload shim that maps only `getpid()` to `/proc/self`; the pinned Lean binary now reports the exact locked version/commit. I’m rerunning the unchanged trusted preflight with that narrowly scoped environment fix.
